OL,3,GNEWSAReport reveals strain on crews
OL,4,Atackling 40-day fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FFire crews faced significant pressure
OL,7,Fwhile tackling a moorland blaze which
OL,8,Fburned for 40 days, a report has found.
OL,10,FAccording to the report into North
OL,11,FYorkshire Fire and Rescue Service's
OL,12,Fperformance and development, staff
OL,13,Fshowed "exceptional commitment" during
OL,14,Fthe blaze in the North York Moors
OL,15,FNational Park which started in early
OL,16,FAugust 2025.
OL,18,FHowever, firefighters struggled to
OL,19,Fbalance their work with their normal
OL,20,Fduties - including responding to other
OL,21,Femergencies - and their other
OL,22,Femployment.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
