OL,3,GNEWSAReport reveals strain on crews
OL,4,Atackling 40-day fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs a result of the report, the service
OL,7,Fhas been recommended to develop better
OL,8,Farrangements for relieving and rotating
OL,9,Fcrews during lengthy incidents to
OL,10,Fprotect staff welfare and maintain
OL,11,Femergency cover.
